{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Joanna, check this out! I won my fourth video game tournament on Friday! It was awesome competing and showing off my skills - and the victory was indescribable. I'm really proud that I can make money doing what I love. This one was online!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-f5b8f2ec14b2c847018407f9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.689333+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f5b8f2ec14b2c847018407f9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f5b8f2ec14b2c847018407f9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Congrats, Nate! That's awesome! So proud of you. Your hard work really paid off - keep it up! BTW, I took a road trip for research for my next movie while you were winning. Much-needed break and a chance to explore new places and get inspired."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-89bdc913ad3caa64900c39ee", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.713736+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "89bdc913ad3caa64900c39ee", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "89bdc913ad3caa64900c39ee", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Thanks, Joanna! Your support means a lot to me. That road trip sounds great! Where did you go? Did you discover any interesting places?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-ee8e160416ecb549a0a14a79", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.726842+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ee8e160416ecb549a0a14a79", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ee8e160416ecb549a0a14a79", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks Nate! Appreciate your kind words. I went to Woodhaven, a small town in the Midwest. Got to see some lovely scenery and historic buildings. Checked out the library there, it had a cool old book collection!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-95615bb9609c49e1e1dfc55c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.736972+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "95615bb9609c49e1e1dfc55c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "95615bb9609c49e1e1dfc55c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That place looks interesting! Did you find any cool books there?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-85fc4c595eed6942ae99c8f7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.752246+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "85fc4c595eed6942ae99c8f7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "85fc4c595eed6942ae99c8f7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I stumbled upon this super cool book from the 1900s with stories and sketches - so awesome to read about the town and the people living there!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-87eed69cd2043e4870410ff8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.763307+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "87eed69cd2043e4870410ff8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "87eed69cd2043e4870410ff8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That sounds really interesting! Anyting specific stick out to you about it?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-950134ca371693595b6345ec", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.775306+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "950134ca371693595b6345ec", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "950134ca371693595b6345ec", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Woodhaven has had an interesting past with lots of cool people. Seeing how much it changed sparked ideas for my next script."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-0357bd14438eb8c2f2712143", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.786309+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0357bd14438eb8c2f2712143", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0357bd14438eb8c2f2712143", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Real-life stories are the best for inspiration. Can't wait to hear about your next one. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-60e41ca1ac281cc9b6b1d8c4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.796817+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "60e41ca1ac281cc9b6b1d8c4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "60e41ca1ac281cc9b6b1d8c4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! I'm stoked about this new script. It's different from my previous work, but it has the potential to be something awesome! I'll be sure to keep you posted."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-06ccfe0e7080482d25e390ec", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.805537+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "06ccfe0e7080482d25e390ec", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "06ccfe0e7080482d25e390ec", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I'm sure it will do just as well as your last one! Keep on trying and believe in yourself!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-33f3741664fb3390d00249ce", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.816604+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "33f3741664fb3390d00249ce", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "33f3741664fb3390d00249ce", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! Your encouragement really means a lot to me. You're the best for supporting me in my writing journey."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-ac0ec3ec83e6c91243e9d542", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.825842+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ac0ec3ec83e6c91243e9d542", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ac0ec3ec83e6c91243e9d542", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I'm always here for you! You've got so much talent, just keep going for it!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-58474995ccc55b7825a49bc9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.836042+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "58474995ccc55b7825a49bc9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "58474995ccc55b7825a49bc9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I will! I actually started on a book recently since my movie did well!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-c527d0b023827aba35f47b41", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.847141+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c527d0b023827aba35f47b41", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c527d0b023827aba35f47b41", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Nice! I'm curious, what is it about?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-a8755b026244376cc2c2427c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.857264+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a8755b026244376cc2c2427c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a8755b026244376cc2c2427c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: That page specifically has some dialogues exploring loss, redemption, and forgiveness. It's a deep and emotional story that I'm really excited about!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-215c9e7821dbd1bd1182cdf9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.867266+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "215c9e7821dbd1bd1182cdf9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "215c9e7821dbd1bd1182cdf9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Wow, Joanna! It sounds awesome. I'm so excited to see how it all plays out!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-96170fae2429e96d546c86f9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.878285+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "96170fae2429e96d546c86f9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "96170fae2429e96d546c86f9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! I'm so glad you're excited. I've never really tried publishing a book, but this might be the first!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-030b88079192d7a799704a91", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.888285+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "030b88079192d7a799704a91", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "030b88079192d7a799704a91", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Good luck on that! I'm sure people will recognise you as the same author of the movie you got published and love the book even more."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-d8d5c46bcb2a80c3ed76aeb9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.897995+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d8d5c46bcb2a80c3ed76aeb9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d8d5c46bcb2a80c3ed76aeb9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! Your belief in me means a lot. I'll keep doing my best. Thanks for the support!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-0a8948b8f858bc7e6cbec8fd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.911215+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0a8948b8f858bc7e6cbec8fd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0a8948b8f858bc7e6cbec8fd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: No problem, Joanna. I'm here for you. Your hard work will pay off, I promise. Believe in yourself and your talent - you're incredible!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_17-b4128ee480ea3aaabc55dcc6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:09:39.921436+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b4128ee480ea3aaabc55dcc6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b4128ee480ea3aaabc55dcc6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
